  <Placemark>
   <name>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 15 at 7:19PM CDT until September 15 at 7:45PM CDT by NWS Norman OK</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_severe</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>SVROUN

The National Weather Service in Norman has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Northeastern Woods County in northwestern Oklahoma...

* Until 745 PM CDT.

* At 719 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located near Alva, moving
northeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...70 mph wind gusts.

SOURCE...ASOS.

IMPACT...Expect considerable tree damage. Damage is likely to
mobile homes, roofs, and outbuildings.

* Locations impacted include...
Alva and Capron.</Snippet>
