   </Style>
   <Snippet>A Marine Weather Statement has been issued for the following areas...
Charlotte Harbor and Pine Island Sound...
Coastal waters from Bonita Beach to Englewood FL out 20 NM...

At 735 PM EDT, Doppler radar indicated a strong thunderstorm, capable
of producing winds to around 30 knots. This thunderstorm was located
over North Captiva Island, moving southwest at 15 knots.</Snippet>
