   <styleUrl>#sev_severe</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>FFWSLC

The National Weather Service in Salt Lake City has issued a

* Flash Flood Warning for...
South Central Emery County in central Utah...

* Until 800 PM MDT.

* At 524 PM MDT, Doppler radar indicated thunderstorms producing
heavy rain across the San Rafael Swell, including Iron Wash, Ernie
Canyon and Eardley Canyon. The expected rainfall rate is 0.5 to
0.75 inches in 30 minutes. Flash flooding is ongoing or expected to
begin shortly.

HAZARD...Life threatening flash flooding. Thunderstorms producing
flash flooding.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Life threatening flash flooding of slot canyons and
normally dry washes.

* Some locations that will experience flash flooding include...
Iron Wash, Ernie Canyon, Eardley Canyon, and other nearby slot
canyons within the San Rafael Swell.</Snippet>
